Pre-requisites – Smart AI Budget & Recommendation Assistant

Pre-requisites are the essential tools, software, and knowledge required to develop and run the Smart AI Budget & Recommendation Assistant successfully.

Programming Language: Python
Development Environment: VS Code / Jupyter Notebook
Libraries: Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn
Database: MySQL or SQLite
AI/ML Knowledge: Basic knowledge of machine learning and recommendation systems
Web Development: Basic HTML, CSS, and Flask/Streamlit
Data: User income, expenses, spending categories, and budget information
System Requirements: Computer with internet connection and Python installed
